  "hints": [
    "Pad A, in the north corridor, keeps the first gate open for three turns after it is left. Pad B, in the west doorway, works only while someone stands on it and holds the second gate and the lift.",
    "One echo can do both: it steps on pad A and walks on, so the countdown holds the first gate while it goes to stand on pad B. Cross the first gate before the countdown ends.",
    "Switch on ROUTE-POWER and record from the console: up, up onto pad A, down, down, left onto pad B, wait two turns and save with {key:echo}. Launch with {key:echo}, then follow the route east, down, and east again to the lift."
  ],
