      "title": "Two pads and a countdown",
      "explanation": "Pad A, in the north corridor, stays on for three turns after you step off it. Pad B, in the west doorway, is on only while someone stands on it. Pad A holds the first gate and pad B holds the second gate and the lift. One echo cannot stand on both, but a countdown lets it leave pad A and still keep the first gate open.",
